%% Hengshi Design Digital Platform - Authentication Flow (February 2026)
%% JWT-based admin authentication with bcrypt password hashing

sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant FE as React SPA<br/>(lib/api.ts)
    participant API as FastAPI<br/>(auth/routes.py)
    participant JWT as JWT Module<br/>(auth/jwt.py)
    participant PWD as Password Module<br/>(auth/password.py)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(users table)

    Note over B,DB: Login Flow

    B->>FE: Submit login form<br/>(email, password)
    FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{email, password}
    API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>API: User record (id, email, password_hash, role)

    alt User not found
        API-->>FE: 401 {"detail": "Invalid credentials"}
        FE-->>B: Show error message
    else User found
        API->>PWD: bcrypt.verify(password, password_hash)

        alt Password invalid
            API-->>FE: 401 {"detail": "Invalid credentials"}
            FE-->>B: Show error message
        else Password valid
            API->>JWT: create_access_token({sub: user_id, email, role})
            JWT-->>API: JWT token (HS256, 120min expiry)
            API-->>FE: 200 {access_token, token_type: "bearer"}
            FE->>FE: Store token in localStorage<br/>⚠️ Migrate to httpOnly cookie (Sprint 1)
            FE-->>B: Redirect to /admin
        end
    end

    Note over B,DB: Authenticated Request Flow

    B->>FE: Admin action (e.g., create service)
    FE->>API: GET /api/admin/services<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    API->>JWT: decode_token(token)

    alt Token invalid/expired
        API-->>FE: 401 {"detail": "Invalid token"}
        FE-->>B: Redirect to /admin/login
    else Token valid
        JWT-->>API: {sub: user_id, email, role: "admin"}
        API->>API: require_admin() — verify role='admin'
        API->>DB: Execute query
        DB-->>API: Results
        API-->>FE: 200 Response data
        FE-->>B: Render admin UI
    end

    Note over B,DB: Security Gaps (Sprint 1 Remediation)
    Note right of API: ❌ No login rate limiting<br/>❌ No JWT secret enforcement<br/>❌ No password complexity
    Note right of FE: ❌ Token in localStorage (XSS risk)<br/>→ Migrate to httpOnly cookies
